{"metadata":{"extendedModule":"AxiamSDK","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC21resendOwnVerificationyyYaKF","title":"resendOwnVerification()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resendOwnVerification"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/api\/v1\/users\/me\/resend-verification"},{"text":" (CONTRACT.md §25.1, §25.7) — resend the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"signed-in caller’s own"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" verification mail, and say what happened.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resendOwnVerification"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Takes no address. The server reads it off the caller’s own record, and this signature"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deliberately offers no way to name a different one: a parameter here would let an"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"authenticated session mail an arbitrary address.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unlike "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/resendVerification(email:tenantID:)"},{"type":"text","text":" this reports the outcome, because the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"caller is signed in to the account it is asking about and none of the outcomes tells"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it anything it did not already bring with it:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"returns — a token was minted and the mail ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"enqueued"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":". Delivery is asynchronous","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and can still fail at the provider; a queue that accepts everything in front of a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"provider that rejects it looks exactly like this succeeding (§25.7 rule 3).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"AxiamError.authz","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (from "},{"code":"409","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") — already verified, or an account state that must"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not be sent a live token."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AxiamError.network"},{"type":"text","text":" (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"429"},{"type":"text","text":") — the daily resend limit."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"§25.7 rule 2 forbids falling back to the unauthenticated endpoint on either failure,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and this SDK does not: that fallback turns both back into a silent success and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"restores the bug this operation exists to fix, with an extra round trip."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Refused client-side with "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"no wire call"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" when there is no session."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/resendownverification()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/resendOwnVerification()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient/resendOwnVerification()":{"title":"resendOwnVerification()","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/resendownverification()","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/api\/v1\/users\/me\/resend-verification"},{"type":"text","text":" (CONTRACT.md §25.1, §25.7) — resend the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"signed-in caller’s own","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" verification mail, and say what happened."}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resendOwnVerification","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/resendOwnVerification()","kind":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient":{"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AxiamClient","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"AxiamClient","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The AXIAM REST client (§1–§7, §9 of CONTRACT.md)."}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AxiamClient","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient/resendVerification(email:tenantID:)":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/api\/v1\/auth\/resend-verification"},{"type":"text","text":" (CONTRACT.md §25.1) — the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"unauthenticated","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" resend, for a caller with no session."}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resendVerification","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"email","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tenantID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/resendverification(email:tenantid:)","title":"resendVerification(email:tenantID:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/resendVerification(email:tenantID:)"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}],"title":"AxiamSDK"}}}